             'June 2024. A two-variable Taylor or Maclaurin expansion is asked in six of them, always a 6–7 mark Q1 '
             'part: Jul 2023 Q1.b and Dec 2023 Q1.b ($\\sin x\\sin y$ about $(\\frac\\pi4,\\frac\\pi4)$, second order '
